WEBVTT

00:07.660 --> 00:09.020
I'm gonna be late!

00:16.310 --> 00:18.530
I'm so unlucky today.

00:20.810 --> 00:23.620
Your hair is messed up.

00:24.490 --> 00:26.160
Thank you very much!

00:27.590 --> 00:29.460
She's so beautiful...

00:29.800 --> 00:31.040
Are you alright?

00:31.970 --> 00:33.420
Yes, I'm alright!

00:33.660 --> 00:35.110
Excuse me.

00:35.550 --> 00:38.330
Ah... So embarrassing.

02:08.540 --> 02:10.600
Onee-sama... Huh?

02:17.670 --> 02:19.530
I barely made it.

02:20.800 --> 02:22.380
Good morning, Kuon-chan.

02:22.380 --> 02:23.960
G-Good morning.

02:24.290 --> 02:26.170
Geez... It was bad.

02:26.270 --> 02:28.220
I worked through the whole of last night.

02:28.220 --> 02:29.780
Hey, Yui-san.

02:30.170 --> 02:33.270
Since you're already tardy, shouldn't you see it fit to watch that attitude?

02:33.460 --> 02:34.800
Do you know what attitude is?

02:35.350 --> 02:39.840
If my attitude is A... What is yours? F? G?

02:40.840 --> 02:42.280
Ah, I'm sorry.

02:42.280 --> 02:45.180
These are merely genetic, it can't be helped.

02:45.180 --> 02:48.110
Someone like Yui-san will never understand.

02:48.770 --> 02:50.440
How can you say that?

02:50.440 --> 02:52.900
You should apologize to Ran-chan and Sumire-chan!

02:53.260 --> 02:54.860
*Sob*

02:54.860 --> 02:57.280
I'm talking about yours, Yui-san.

02:57.400 --> 02:58.670
M-mine?

02:58.800 --> 03:01.430
But... they're made like that.

03:01.430 --> 03:02.530
Right, Kuon-chan?

03:03.680 --> 03:05.220
Uh... I...

03:05.220 --> 03:09.350
Okay, okay. Everyone please go back to your seats.

03:11.570 --> 03:12.640
She puts up a good fight.

03:13.230 --> 03:15.790
Go back to your seats, you idiots!

03:16.710 --> 03:19.270
Don't speak like that, Ayumi.

03:19.390 --> 03:19.980
Okay.

03:21.700 --> 03:23.890
Um... That's why...

03:23.890 --> 03:25.680
Girls should be elegant...

03:25.680 --> 03:28.830
The idol of this school is supposed to be me.

03:28.870 --> 03:31.950
How could I let a new girl screw things up?

03:33.190 --> 03:34.490
Unforgivable.

03:36.320 --> 03:39.740
As a robot... am I suited for these classes?

03:41.580 --> 03:43.330
Could it be... the parts...

03:47.960 --> 03:51.010
Ah! No. I'm still in class!

03:51.220 --> 03:54.300
I'll get expelled if they find out I'm a robot!

03:54.480 --> 03:57.650
What is she doing? Playing with her skirt...

03:57.950 --> 03:59.600
Ah... It couldn't be...

04:00.550 --> 04:03.650
Sensei, Yui-chan is not feeling well.

04:03.650 --> 04:04.320
Eh?

04:04.470 --> 04:07.250
Oh, then someone should take her to the infirmary.

04:07.250 --> 04:08.890
I'll take her.

04:09.200 --> 04:11.390
Yui-chan, are you alright?

04:11.390 --> 04:13.970
I'll leave it to you, class rep.

04:13.970 --> 04:14.780
OK!

04:14.780 --> 04:17.060
Don't let it leak!

04:19.510 --> 04:21.190
I... I'm sorry, mama.

04:30.400 --> 04:32.960
What are you doing, Sumitomo-san?

04:32.960 --> 04:34.710
Bringing me to this place...

04:36.790 --> 04:38.130
W-What is it?

04:38.380 --> 04:44.210
Yui-san, what were you doing in class?

04:44.210 --> 04:45.410
Did she find out?

04:46.640 --> 04:48.850
What are you talking about? I...

04:50.280 --> 04:53.100
Don't play dumb.

04:53.100 --> 04:58.140
I saw it.  You flipped up your skirt.

04:59.690 --> 05:01.980
Were you masturbating?

05:03.440 --> 05:06.050
So... did you do it?

05:06.050 --> 05:09.620
Um... Masturbating...

05:09.930 --> 05:11.970
Masturbating?

05:12.900 --> 05:15.580
It's written all over your face!

05:15.580 --> 05:17.930
T-That's not it... that was...

05:17.930 --> 05:19.980
Yui-san is so bold!

05:19.980 --> 05:22.950
Where did you think you were, doing it during class..?

05:22.950 --> 05:26.560
Shocking! It's a shock to the class-rep!

05:25.700 --> 05:27.970
I wasn't doing something like that!

05:28.720 --> 05:32.280
It's noisy... in this toilet.

05:32.600 --> 05:36.500
I will investigate it thoroughly later.

05:36.500 --> 05:38.560
I told you, it's not like that!

05:40.020 --> 05:42.140
Greetings, onee-sama.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.490
Greetings.

05:47.910 --> 05:49.030
You are?

05:50.210 --> 05:50.990
From this morning...

05:51.250 --> 05:53.120
Do your best.

05:53.120 --> 05:55.360
Yes! Good day.

05:58.650 --> 06:05.370
Occurrences like these are the reason we modified the chip.

06:05.370 --> 06:09.090
It is capable of increasing acceleration threefold.

06:05.660 --> 06:06.980
What is it?

06:08.190 --> 06:11.300
I see, it's nearly lunch.

06:12.010 --> 06:13.170
Nee-sama.

06:15.680 --> 06:19.470
After inserting this, the memory will be...

06:19.470 --> 06:21.230
What are you doing?

06:21.230 --> 06:22.270
We've been discovered.

06:22.270 --> 06:24.360
Get back to your seats!

06:26.150 --> 06:28.530
Hey, you guys, we're still in class.

06:35.240 --> 06:38.330
Kuon-san, we cannot lose.

06:43.420 --> 06:44.890
Nee-sama.

06:44.890 --> 06:45.630
Traps!

06:49.740 --> 06:51.380
That's cheap!

06:51.670 --> 06:52.770
Unforgivable.

06:53.390 --> 06:56.520
That kid... She dodged our attacks.

06:56.570 --> 06:58.730
Nee-sama, we should use that move.

06:58.740 --> 06:59.360
Yeah.

07:00.680 --> 07:03.520
We summon you, Octopus King!

07:10.090 --> 07:14.450
Ah, we've been caught... It's sticky...

07:14.450 --> 07:18.620
Relax and enjoy the world of adults.

07:19.970 --> 07:26.150
Auntie, please give us the special noodle bread.

07:23.580 --> 07:25.840
Here, thank you.

07:27.810 --> 07:30.280
The noodle bread is sold out.

07:30.280 --> 07:31.770
How could that be...

07:31.770 --> 07:34.140
Our battle...

07:34.140 --> 07:37.600
What? Do you want this?

07:37.600 --> 07:39.580
You should act more like a female!

07:39.580 --> 07:41.210
I'm sorry.

07:45.260 --> 07:46.640
Both of you...

07:47.690 --> 07:50.680
Why did you ditch class...

07:51.150 --> 07:55.040
Ah! So it's me again?

07:55.790 --> 07:58.080
Don't give us useless lectures.

07:58.810 --> 08:01.940
Yui-san, why are you so wet?

08:01.960 --> 08:04.130
You keep getting yourself into these suggestive situations...

08:05.060 --> 08:06.820
That's not it!

08:10.440 --> 08:12.560
It's all wet and disgusting.

08:12.550 --> 08:14.530
Is there anyone here?

08:14.620 --> 08:17.710
Sensei, don't touch that place.

08:17.980 --> 08:19.960
Hey, wait...

08:22.160 --> 08:26.980
What's wrong with this school? Even in the infirmary...

08:30.030 --> 08:30.780
Kuon-chan!

08:30.780 --> 08:31.990
Who there!?

08:34.790 --> 08:36.540
What's with that outfit?

08:37.630 --> 08:38.810
Are you jealous?

08:38.810 --> 08:39.570
Y-You're wrong!

08:39.370 --> 08:42.040
I guess it can't be helped, I'll let you wear it too.

08:42.920 --> 08:44.170
That's not Murase-san.

08:44.770 --> 08:45.650
Sakuya-kun.

08:45.650 --> 08:47.000
Yes, Sensei.

08:47.290 --> 08:49.240
Wait, what are you doing!?

08:49.240 --> 08:50.760
It's fine, it's fine.

08:50.760 --> 08:53.210
Here, Sensei. Do what you need to do.

08:55.550 --> 08:57.270
Please stop!

09:01.840 --> 09:04.670
No! If someone sees that place...

09:06.100 --> 09:09.230
Not obeying the rules, abusing privileges, harassing people.

09:09.370 --> 09:10.500
Onee-sama.

09:11.630 --> 09:13.110
Dad, what are you doing?

09:13.300 --> 09:14.840
Uh... This is...

09:14.970 --> 09:16.740
Dad is a big pervert!

09:16.740 --> 09:18.370
Wait for me, Minori.

09:19.130 --> 09:22.760
That's not it... we were just messing around...

09:24.180 --> 09:26.400
I'm sorry!

09:27.470 --> 09:29.810
Amazing, doing something like that.

09:33.700 --> 09:37.050
Thank you! I got saved by you again.

09:37.320 --> 09:38.510
It's alright now.

09:40.060 --> 09:42.940
What is this? My heart is beating so fast.

09:44.220 --> 09:46.810
I've always been watching you.

09:46.950 --> 09:48.290
Onee-sama.

09:50.870 --> 09:51.990
This...

09:52.780 --> 09:55.440
But... If it's her...

09:58.760 --> 10:00.450
Yui, sorry for the wait.

10:02.410 --> 10:04.670
Huh? Are you playing a game?

10:05.280 --> 10:07.120
That's enough for today.

10:07.180 --> 10:10.700
Anyhow, imagining these kinds of boring plots in your mind...

10:10.700 --> 10:12.360
Is it really so amusing?

10:13.400 --> 10:16.510
If Yui was in the same grade as me...

10:18.720 --> 10:22.600
These types of fantasies... they're only allowed in games!

10:22.700 --> 10:25.810
Besides, if Murase-san had gotten me while he was a student,

10:25.810 --> 10:28.300
I would have left him for a different master.

10:28.560 --> 10:32.580
True, luckily I bought you when I started working.

10:34.360 --> 10:37.780
Oh yeah, where does Murase-san work?

10:40.570 --> 10:43.160
I've always been watching you.

10:49.380 --> 10:51.080
Stop peeking!

10:51.210 --> 10:52.920
How about a fantasy genre next time?

10:53.050 --> 10:58.740
Murase-san, you're really the worst!

11:00.760 --> 11:02.860
My most important...

11:05.640 --> 11:09.080
Um... It hasn't been long since our marriage.

11:10.020 --> 11:16.350
Kuon-san is always laying around here and watching T.V.

11:16.680 --> 11:18.540
What is it? Do you have a problem with that?

11:18.570 --> 11:19.440
Uh...

11:21.090 --> 11:25.040
Could it be... that I'm a nuisance, Yui-san?"

11:25.230 --> 11:28.490
You don't understand the anguish of wanting to work, but not getting offered a job.

11:28.500 --> 11:31.670
There's also a lot of other things you can do.

11:32.810 --> 11:36.090
Being a maid robot that's loved by its master must feel nice.

11:36.620 --> 11:40.110
He's always calling out "Yui, Yui!".

11:40.110 --> 11:42.460
I'm envious of the love-love.

11:42.460 --> 11:44.830
What love-love?

11:44.830 --> 11:49.600
Murase-san just uses me to fulfill his own interests.

11:49.960 --> 11:54.780
But, even if your relationship is good with him... Don't forget this one thing...

11:55.840 --> 12:00.970
No matter what, as a maid robot, we have to serve our masters.

12:00.970 --> 12:03.760
So, it's about the respect to a maid robot.

12:04.840 --> 12:07.400
I can really see your point there.

12:10.950 --> 12:11.840
What's this?

12:11.940 --> 12:15.780
It's like a left over maid robot lecturing about maids.

12:15.780 --> 12:18.560
Don't always think like that.

12:18.560 --> 12:22.790
Why don't you go back to the showroom and find a good master?

12:23.350 --> 12:24.810
I'm home, Yui.

12:25.650 --> 12:27.160
Were you behaving yourself, Yui?

12:27.610 --> 12:29.350
Welcome home, Murase-san.

12:29.460 --> 12:31.060
Kuon-chan, you came.

12:32.690 --> 12:34.950
Please excuse me, Murase-san.

12:35.260 --> 12:37.850
I'm always under the care of Yui-san.

12:37.980 --> 12:41.940
It's alright, Kuon-chan is always so polite and beautiful.

12:42.060 --> 12:45.160
Ah, Murase-san, you're very sweet.

12:46.850 --> 12:48.860
An amazing personality change.

12:52.570 --> 12:53.560
Hello?

12:54.020 --> 12:54.940
Oh, hello.

12:55.220 --> 12:56.330
Do you want it now?

12:56.970 --> 12:59.160
Ah, I'll be right over.

12:59.750 --> 13:00.700
Sorry, Yui.

13:00.800 --> 13:03.280
I have to go back now.

13:03.480 --> 13:06.260
What's with it today... It must be a hard day.

13:06.260 --> 13:07.970
Then, Yui. I'm going now.

13:14.030 --> 13:19.150
I can tell from the tired and exhausted Murase-san, you both are really love-love.

13:20.420 --> 13:23.940
It must be the special love from a maid robot.

13:24.410 --> 13:27.640
Murase-san... He came back tired and late last night.

13:28.060 --> 13:29.380
Did he change?

13:31.120 --> 13:34.240
I'm happy that Murase-san can be so serious about one thing.

13:34.430 --> 13:38.630
But how should I put it...

13:38.630 --> 13:40.520
That won't do.

13:43.160 --> 13:46.800
No wonder Takaya-kun hasn't been coming often.

13:47.220 --> 13:50.660
Then what is Murase-san doing?

13:50.930 --> 13:54.370
I thought he cared about Yui-chan.

13:54.370 --> 13:56.550
I don't get it.

13:56.550 --> 13:57.710
It's a woman.

13:58.500 --> 14:01.190
Miss, this is your master's affair.

14:02.990 --> 14:06.220
You've got to be joking... Kuon-san...

14:06.220 --> 14:08.360
Murase-san isn't like that!

14:08.390 --> 14:10.830
Ta... ka... ya!

14:11.870 --> 14:14.730
Takaya, Takaya, Takaya!

14:17.240 --> 14:20.560
Oh, it's Kuon-chan. Why are you here?

14:22.090 --> 14:24.760
Sa... ku... ya... san...

14:24.760 --> 14:29.190
Even though you are MP's best and newest model...

14:29.190 --> 14:34.060
Don't look down on Maid Work's maid robots...

14:35.220 --> 14:37.250
Hey, isn't Takaya here?

14:37.370 --> 14:39.500
Takaya-kun is not here today.

14:39.570 --> 14:41.960
I still haven't finished yet.

14:41.960 --> 14:46.010
Oh... I saw him around here just now, so I thought he came here.

14:46.030 --> 14:47.700
Wait, did you hear that?!

14:46.800 --> 14:47.820
Murase-san?

14:47.820 --> 14:53.000
Um... It was when Sakuya was advertising for MP just then.

14:51.920 --> 14:55.770
This is from MP, best regards!

14:56.440 --> 14:59.870
I saw Takaya together with some unknown woman.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.920
I wonder where he was going.

15:05.840 --> 15:08.380
Then, we shall confirm it.

15:20.230 --> 15:22.420
Mama, there are some weird people.

15:22.420 --> 15:25.020
Oh my. Just ignore them.

15:25.020 --> 15:30.650
Sakuya-san, Murase-san walked in this direction, right?

15:31.800 --> 15:34.580
I lost sight of them.

15:35.580 --> 15:39.960
Let's stop this.  Murase-san is entitled to his privacy.

15:40.290 --> 15:41.880
What are you talking about?

15:41.880 --> 15:46.310
It's normal for a maid robot to find out what her master is doing!

15:46.310 --> 15:47.610
That's right, Yui-chan.

15:47.610 --> 15:48.420
But...

15:49.000 --> 15:51.130
Look there, Kuon-chan.

15:53.770 --> 15:54.730
That is...

15:55.460 --> 15:58.030
What? Murase-san is by himself.

15:58.030 --> 15:59.100
Murase-san.

16:05.990 --> 16:07.900
Murase... san?

16:07.900 --> 16:09.940
Takaya!

16:12.290 --> 16:13.280
What is it?

16:13.610 --> 16:15.830
I thought someone called my name.

16:15.830 --> 16:21.180
You're imagining things, we've gotten rid of our baggage, let's go to my house.

16:21.180 --> 16:24.080
Ah, yeah. Let's go.

16:27.760 --> 16:30.130
Ayumi, where are you?

16:31.260 --> 16:33.730
Takaya is gone!

16:33.730 --> 16:36.520
He really <i>is</i>  with another woman.

16:36.810 --> 16:39.810
They also looked very romantic...

16:40.690 --> 16:43.170
Sakuya wants to go too!

16:43.170 --> 16:45.840
But, the truth has been revealed now.

16:45.840 --> 16:48.230
What... should I do?

16:49.420 --> 16:52.000
But... Murase-san...

16:52.000 --> 16:54.610
You don't need to do anything.

16:55.740 --> 16:57.670
We are only maid robots.

16:58.150 --> 17:03.820
As maids, we must respect our Masters' wishes.

17:03.930 --> 17:08.340
If Takaya is happy, Sakuya will be happy too!

17:08.510 --> 17:10.880
What... even Sakuya-san...

17:11.170 --> 17:17.030
No matter what, treating your master's wishes as number one is a duty of a maid robot.

17:18.530 --> 17:21.130
That is... a maid robot's...

17:21.990 --> 17:22.790
But...

17:32.900 --> 17:34.180
Your name.

17:36.620 --> 17:40.100
I thought of it long before I met you, a name which only belongs to you.

17:41.750 --> 17:42.580
Yui...

17:43.350 --> 17:45.860
A name... which belongs to me.

17:46.810 --> 17:47.980
My...

17:48.640 --> 17:49.740
Murase-san.

17:52.910 --> 17:57.300
My... important... memories.

17:57.300 --> 17:58.820
Yui-san!

18:13.460 --> 18:16.230
Yui, how is she?

18:16.770 --> 18:19.680
About that...  There are no apparent problems.

18:21.300 --> 18:25.240
Then why won't Yui open her eyes?

18:25.740 --> 18:30.280
Due to severe stress on her processor, the system initiated an emergency shutdown.

18:30.600 --> 18:35.160
Normally, it would reboot after some time.

18:35.800 --> 18:37.380
Then why?!

18:46.560 --> 18:49.020
Hey, Yui... Why?

18:49.390 --> 18:50.790
What's wrong, Yui..?

18:51.060 --> 18:51.980
Open your eyes!

18:52.340 --> 18:54.960
It's a nice day like an Indian Summer.

19:07.610 --> 19:12.000
I really don't know, when did this shop start to break down..?

19:12.560 --> 19:17.050
My dream shop is still open for business!

19:18.340 --> 19:20.610
You must be joking, Master.

19:20.610 --> 19:23.750
Kanae-san made an unnecessary joke.

19:25.790 --> 19:29.740
But except for us today, no one came, Mama.

19:29.900 --> 19:31.230
You're wrong, Ayumi.

19:31.230 --> 19:32.470
It's the same today.

19:33.370 --> 19:36.770
That... even though we had the same feeling some time ago...

19:36.880 --> 19:41.290
After Yui-san and Takaya-san came, the customers...

19:41.450 --> 19:42.700
That's true.

19:42.700 --> 19:47.180
Yui-san is the moe and warm-type of this shop.

19:48.060 --> 19:51.380
Unfortunately, there's only the sexy and the joking-type left.

19:53.380 --> 19:57.050
What? Who's the sexy and joking-type you're talking about?

19:57.340 --> 20:00.880
Seriously, putting this aside. Why did Takaya leave too?!

20:01.020 --> 20:02.080
Ayumi.

20:02.570 --> 20:05.760
Takaya-kun wants to spend more time with Yui-chan.

20:06.040 --> 20:08.630
He hopes she can see him when she opens her eyes.

20:10.520 --> 20:12.890
It's always Yui... it's unfair!

20:15.030 --> 20:16.040
That's true.

20:16.510 --> 20:20.030
I sometimes feel what Ayumi-chan is feeling.

20:21.310 --> 20:24.480
But I... Because I'm good friends with Yui-chan...

20:24.480 --> 20:26.450
That's why I love Yui-chan.

20:26.620 --> 20:28.540
Even the shop is like this...

20:28.820 --> 20:31.920
Dad, I'm going to see Yui-chan.

20:32.170 --> 20:33.670
Sure, I don't mind.

20:33.670 --> 20:35.890
W-Wait a moment!

20:38.530 --> 20:42.050
Hot coffee, a treat for Takaya-kun.

20:42.220 --> 20:45.490
If it's like that, take mine too.

20:45.830 --> 20:48.890
It's not good if you don't eat properly.

20:49.350 --> 20:52.100
Dad... Kanae-san...

20:56.090 --> 20:57.500
I'll lend this to Yui.

20:57.890 --> 21:01.690
I'm only lending it! She has to give it back later!

21:03.860 --> 21:05.250
Tsundere.

21:08.130 --> 21:10.320
What are you all doing?

21:14.430 --> 21:17.000
Really... You're an idiot.

21:30.540 --> 21:32.840
Just leave the chores to Sakuya!

21:33.190 --> 21:35.940
When Yui wakes up, she won't need to worry about it.

21:35.940 --> 21:37.790
Because I've done everything.

21:39.920 --> 21:42.150
Yui always says that she doesn't like it...

21:42.260 --> 21:45.200
But she has kept the clothes that Takaya made.

21:45.560 --> 21:46.250
Ouch...

22:03.540 --> 22:06.230
It's good, as expected from Kuon.

22:06.230 --> 22:08.180
Thank you very much, store manager.

22:12.680 --> 22:14.330
Are you worried about Yui-chan?

22:16.670 --> 22:20.320
Uh... That... Not really...

22:21.500 --> 22:22.190
Yes.

22:23.270 --> 22:24.710
It's good to be honest.

22:25.640 --> 22:27.970
But, I don't think it's just that.

22:28.130 --> 22:30.440
Are you pondering something else?

22:34.080 --> 22:38.210
Even though it's late, but why did Yui-san faint suddenly?

22:38.670 --> 22:41.640
No matter what the master feels...

22:41.640 --> 22:45.640
Serving the master wholeheartedly is the duty of a maid robot.

22:45.690 --> 22:48.370
Yeah, Kuon is right.

22:48.490 --> 22:50.910
But Yui-chan is correct too, that's it.

22:51.090 --> 22:52.110
I've said it before.

22:53.570 --> 22:58.810
The relationship between a master and a maid is created by themselves.

23:00.020 --> 23:03.190
A person that is... destined to you.

23:03.310 --> 23:06.860
Yep, that's why Yui-chan will wake up.

23:07.160 --> 23:09.170
For Murase-san's sake.

23:10.610 --> 23:11.440
But...

23:11.670 --> 23:13.690
Even if Yui-san thinks like this... What about Murase-san?

23:14.670 --> 23:19.450
To be honest, he has a good relationship with other females...

23:22.540 --> 23:27.420
About that, I think I should clarify something.

23:27.830 --> 23:31.230
Because Kuon still hasn't noticed yet.

23:31.740 --> 23:32.720
Store manager?

23:46.850 --> 23:49.840
Look, Yui, I finished another one.

23:54.580 --> 23:57.330
So... wake up already.

23:59.190 --> 24:02.790
Sumitomo-san, Master, Kanae-san, Ayumi-chan...

24:03.200 --> 24:05.430
Kuon-chan, Sakuya and the store manager...

24:06.180 --> 24:08.360
Everyone is waiting for Yui.

24:15.760 --> 24:19.050
I can't say it... I've already woken up.

24:19.050 --> 24:21.780
But everyone is so serious about it...

24:21.780 --> 24:23.850
I don't have the courage to wake up...

24:23.850 --> 24:26.910
How can I say it now?

24:27.090 --> 24:27.980
But...

24:29.780 --> 24:30.940
If it's like this...

24:31.130 --> 24:34.030
Murase-san will always be by my side.

24:34.760 --> 24:38.230
Not with that person, but by <i>my</i> side.

24:39.290 --> 24:43.960
But, if I'm just using Murase-san's feeling of kindness...

24:44.460 --> 24:47.310
I.... What should I do?

24:48.620 --> 24:50.260
Oh, you're still here.

25:02.980 --> 25:05.310
Why is that person here?

25:07.320 --> 25:09.510
Huh... What...?

25:09.650 --> 25:10.740
Murase-san?

25:11.720 --> 25:14.970
No! Murase-san!

25:22.170 --> 25:24.860
W-Where are you going?

25:25.870 --> 25:26.750
Yui?

25:27.170 --> 25:30.330
That sort of thing... That sort of thing...

25:30.950 --> 25:33.000
I don't want that sort of thing!

25:33.370 --> 25:35.470
How can I sleep peacefully?

25:37.550 --> 25:39.180
Yui... you...

25:41.980 --> 25:43.710
Um... That...

25:44.430 --> 25:45.790
Good morning, Yui.

25:48.620 --> 25:49.920
No fair!

25:50.080 --> 25:52.880
How can you put on a normal face in this type of situation?

25:53.110 --> 25:56.290
If it's like that... It makes me look like an idiot!

25:56.330 --> 25:57.790
Y-Yui?

25:57.790 --> 26:01.440
Even if I'm an idiot, just listen to me!

26:01.440 --> 26:04.910
Does Murase-san think that a normal woman is better?

26:04.910 --> 26:05.540
Eh?

26:05.620 --> 26:07.750
Don't you need me anymore?

26:07.750 --> 26:09.750
I can't leave Murase-san, no matter what.

26:09.750 --> 26:15.860
A normal maid robot like me... Can't I be with you?

26:14.810 --> 26:16.770
I only need Yui.

26:19.410 --> 26:22.070
No matter what type of girl or maid robot...

26:22.560 --> 26:23.770
I only need Yui.

26:24.710 --> 26:26.600
Murase-san... that's...

26:26.920 --> 26:29.060
Uh... Uh...

26:31.230 --> 26:33.320
So easily...

26:33.320 --> 26:36.990
Then what was I troubled by?

26:37.310 --> 26:39.550
Anyways, who is that person?

26:39.620 --> 26:40.850
Yui-san, I'm sorry.

26:41.820 --> 26:43.560
K-Kuon-san?

26:49.250 --> 26:50.580
It's bright!

26:55.580 --> 26:59.200
Image change... Store Manager?

26:59.980 --> 27:01.120
Why is it like that?

27:01.120 --> 27:04.930
Why are you wearing clothes that makes you look like you're going to have a duel?

27:05.170 --> 27:06.880
What do you mean?

27:07.010 --> 27:11.410
I dress like this when I'm not working.

27:11.860 --> 27:14.780
Even Kuon didn't know... I'm surprised.

27:15.190 --> 27:19.410
It was just discussing about the new maid robot's abilities and looks.

27:19.620 --> 27:21.530
I got excited too...

27:21.660 --> 27:25.820
Thanks to Murase-san, I've got plenty of good ideas.

27:26.610 --> 27:28.200
It ends like this?

27:28.320 --> 27:30.830
Then my troubles... what...

27:31.080 --> 27:33.630
Hello, everyone's here.

27:33.740 --> 27:34.900
Eh? Yui-chan?!

27:35.050 --> 27:36.590
Yui woke up!

27:36.590 --> 27:38.460
Thank god, Yui!

27:38.460 --> 27:40.540
Oh, it's Yui-chan.

27:40.540 --> 27:41.760
Yui-chan.

27:41.760 --> 27:44.030
W-Wait... Everyone?

27:44.030 --> 27:46.190
Well then, ready, set...

27:53.670 --> 27:58.270
Honestly, ever since I met Murase-san I've been having a ridiculously hard time.

27:58.500 --> 28:01.490
Yeah, it'll probably be like that from now on.

28:01.910 --> 28:02.890
That's why it's like this...

28:04.770 --> 28:07.660
There's nothing keeping us from making more good memories.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.300
Murase-san.

29:44.300 --> 29:45.010
Hmm?

29:45.490 --> 29:48.400
It's an Indian Summer today.
